],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids shows March to April came in under 90% of normal in 41 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle ran 38% of normal for September to October 2025 and 36% for October to November 2025. In 2026 so far, May to June 2026 came in at 176% of normal on the middle. Grid 10329 had its driest year in 2011 at 45% of normal.</p>"}
